Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.19,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}وأنا ليه كل ما بتعصّب… ألاقي قولوني اتنفخ؟
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.19,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}Why does my colon bloat every time I get upset?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.25,0:00:06.88,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}أو لو عندي مشوار مهم… أو حتى إنترفيو في الشغل
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.25,0:00:06.88,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}Before something important… even a job interview?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.91,0:00:10.61,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}ألاقي بطني بدأت تتنفخ… وأحس إنها زي البالونة
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.91,0:00:10.61,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}My belly starts to swell… like a balloon.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.64,0:00:13.29,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}وتروح تكشف مرة… واتنين… وتلاتة
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.64,0:00:13.29,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}You see a doctor once, twice, three times…
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.32,0:00:17.02,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}ويقولك: إنت كويس…\Nدي اضطرابات قولون بس موجودة معاك
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.32,0:00:17.02,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}and they say: you're fine, it's just a bowel disorder.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.05,0:00:20.12,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}الفترة اللي فاتت… ونتيجة تطور الأبحاث في الطب
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.05,0:00:20.12,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}In recent years, as medical research advanced,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.15,0:00:24.09,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}اكتشفنا إن في مخ تاني…\Nموجود حوالين الجهاز الهضمي
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.15,0:00:24.09,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}we found a "second brain" around the digestive system,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:24.12,0:00:27.40,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}اللي هو مسمّى بـ محور الأمعاء والمخ
Dialogue: 2,0:00:24.12,0:00:27.40,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}known as the Gut–Brain Axis.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.58,0:00:30.49,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}وده على اتصال ٢٤ ساعة بالمخ
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.58,0:00:30.49,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}It talks to the brain 24 hours a day
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.54,0:00:34.35,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}عن طريق سلك صغير… اسمه العصب الحائر
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.54,0:00:34.35,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}through a small "wire" called the vagus nerve,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.41,0:00:39.24,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}يبدأ يدّي إشارات عصبية عكسية…\Nما بين المخ والجهاز الهضمي
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.41,0:00:39.24,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}sending signals back and forth between brain and gut.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.27,0:00:44.56,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}فلما يحصل معايا توتر…\Nبطني تتنفخ وأحس إنها زي البالونة
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.27,0:00:44.56,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}So when I'm stressed, my belly swells like a balloon.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.61,0:00:49.30,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}خلّي بالك… إن هرمون السعادة\Nبيطلع من جهازك الهضمي
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.61,0:00:49.30,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}The "happy hormone" comes from your gut —
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.34,0:00:52.15,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}و٩٠٪ منه… بيتصنع هناك
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.34,0:00:52.15,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}90% of it is made there.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.18,0:00:55.27,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}عشان كده طالما قولونك مضطرب…
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.18,0:00:55.27,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}So as long as your colon is upset,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.30,0:00:57.64,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}هيكون مزاجك مش رايق
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.30,0:00:57.64,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}your mood will be off too.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:57.67,0:01:01.40,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}والسر كله… إن إحنا لازم نبتدي نهدّي نفسنا
Dialogue: 2,0:00:57.67,0:01:01.40,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}The key: we need to start calming ourselves down
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.43,0:01:03.86,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}ونظبط الأكل اللي بناكله
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.43,0:01:03.86,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}and fix what we eat —
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.03,0:01:08.94,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}اللي بيهيّج القولون…\Nلما بيتخمّر بطريقة معيّنة
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.03,0:01:08.94,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}food that irritates the colon as it ferments.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.97,0:01:11.26,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}في حاجات لازم نبدأ نبعد عنها
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.97,0:01:11.26,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}Some foods we should start avoiding,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.42,0:01:15.89,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}عشان دي من الحاجات اللي بتسبب هيجان للقولون
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.42,0:01:15.89,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}because they irritate the colon,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:15.94,0:01:18.13,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}زي التوم… وزي البصل
Dialogue: 2,0:01:15.94,0:01:18.13,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}like garlic… and onions,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.17,0:01:21.41,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}وأحيانًا السكر اللي في اللبن
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.17,0:01:21.41,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}and sometimes the sugar in milk (lactose).
Dialogue: 2,0:01:21.44,0:01:25.91,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}وكمان نتجنّب تمامًا…\Nإن أنا آكل وأنا متعصّب
Dialogue: 2,0:01:21.44,0:01:25.91,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}Also, never eat while you're upset,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.94,0:01:29.36,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}لأن ده بيزوّد الاضطرابات والكركبة عن الأول
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.94,0:01:29.36,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}because it makes the bloating and rumbling worse.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:29.39,0:01:33.41,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}وأحيانًا بنحتاج نستخدم مضادات للتقلصات
Dialogue: 2,0:01:29.39,0:01:33.41,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}Sometimes we need antispasmodics
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.44,0:01:37.39,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}وحاجات بتساعد على زيادة\Nالبكتيريا النافعة في القولون
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.44,0:01:37.39,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}and things that boost the good bacteria in the colon.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:37.42,0:01:39.30,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}أنا د. أبوبكر أحمد سند
Dialogue: 2,0:01:37.42,0:01:39.30,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}I'm Dr. Abobakr Ahmed Sanad,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:39.49,0:01:42.35,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}أخصائي الباطنة والجهاز الهضمي والكبد
Dialogue: 2,0:01:39.49,0:01:42.35,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}Internal Medicine, GI & Liver Specialist.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:42.38,0:01:44.62,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}وبقولك… خلّي بالك من نفسك
Dialogue: 2,0:01:42.38,0:01:44.62,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}Take care of yourself,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.65,0:01:47.02,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1210)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}لأن أساس العلاج الصح… هو التشخيص الصح
Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.65,0:01:47.02,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}because the right treatment starts with the right diagnosis.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:14.83,0:00:17.43,Stk,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1520)\frz4\fad(90,160)\fscx55\fscy55\t(0,200,\fscx106\fscy106)\t(200,320,\fscx100\fscy100)}القولون العصبي · IBS
Dialogue: 3,0:00:25.05,0:00:27.65,Stk,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1520)\frz4\fad(90,160)\fscx55\fscy55\t(0,200,\fscx106\fscy106)\t(200,320,\fscx100\fscy100)}Gut–Brain Axis
