Dialogue: 3,0:00:49.90,0:00:52.50,Stk,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1520)\frz4\fad(90,160)\fscx55\fscy55\t(0,200,\fscx106\fscy106)\t(200,320,\fscx100\fscy100)}٩٠٪ من هرمون السعادة
